Section: 5.1. Ongoing - OGTD v2.0 and OffensEval 2020
Text: Acknowledgements We would like to acknowledge Maria, Raphael and Anas- tasia, the team of volunteer annotators that provided their free time and efforts to help us produce v1.0 of the dataset of Greek tweets for offensive language detection, as well as Fotini and that helped review tweets with ambivalent la- bels. Additionally, we would like to express our sincere gratitude to the LightTag team and especially to Tal Perry for granting us free use for their annotation platform.

